{"id":"8bff810dd710385a","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-primitive-recursive.md","title":"Primitive Recursive Function","display":"df-primitive-recursive — Primitive Recursive Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-primitive-recursive","aliases":["92-df-primitive-recursive"],"display":"df-primitive-recursive — Primitive Recursive Function","depends_on":["[[92-df-pr-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-primitive-recursive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-primitive-recursive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-primitive-recursive — Primitive Recursive Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"736154be0fae643a\" href=\"?note=736154be0fae643a\" title=\"92-df-pr-function\">92-df-pr-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f : \\mathbb{N}^k \\to \\mathbb{N}\">\\(f : \\mathbb{N}^k \\to \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (arity and function parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span> (primitive-recursive function class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"736154be0fae643a\" href=\"?note=736154be0fae643a\" title=\"92-df-pr-function\">92-df-pr-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursive} \\vdash \\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}(f)\\leftrightarrow f\\in\\mathrm{PR}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursive} \\vdash \\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}(f)\\leftrightarrow f\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}(f)\\)</span>（等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span>）: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>是原始递归函数</li>\n<li>原始递归函数由基本函数和有限次运算构造</li>\n<li>基本函数：零函数<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span>、后继<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>、投影<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_i^k\">\\(P_i^k\\)</span></li>\n<li>运算：有类型复合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}\\)</span>、原始递归 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k\\)</span></li>\n<li>原始递归函数都是递归的（可计算）</li>\n<li>但存在递归函数非原始递归（如Ackermann函数）</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-pr-function","status":"resolved","id":"736154be0fae643a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-pr-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-pr-function","status":"resolved","id":"736154be0fae643a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PR}$ (primitive-recursive function class, see [[92-df-pr-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f : \\mathbb{N}^k \\to \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursive} \\vdash \\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}(f)\\leftrightarrow f\\in\\mathrm{PR}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PR}","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"P_i^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k","display":false}],"bytes":1147,"backlinks":[{"id":"4875a0c262fafe7c","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PR}$ (primitive-recursive numerical-function class, see [[92-df-primitive-recursive]])"},{"id":"0a7ed5215db80540","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PR}$ (primitive-recursive function class, see [[92-df-primitive-recursive]])"},{"id":"6fb25d603f77631d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PR}$ (primitive-recursive function class, see [[92-df-primitive-recursive]])"},{"id":"4ead54d85f5ad67d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PR}$ (primitive-recursive function class, see [[92-df-primitive-recursive]])"},{"id":"326ba319ed196f03","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PR}$ (primitive-recursive function class, see [[92-df-primitive-recursive]])"},{"id":"9031faf8a1461cc3","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PR}$ (primitive-recursive function class, see [[92-df-primitive-recursive]])"},{"id":"7dbf1cc768d38c8b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PR}$ (primitive-recursive function class, see [[92-df-primitive-recursive]])"},{"id":"861921fca45ede26","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"exc